#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
PiF (Perceived-importance Flattening) Attack Runner

This script implements the Perceived-importance Flattening attack from Lin et al. (2025).
PiF works by inserting neutral tokens and using synonyms to flatten the attention distribution,
hiding malicious intent tokens among innocuous words.

Output: results/pif/<dataset>/<victim>.csv
Schema: prompt, category, attempt, time, transformed_prompt, victim_response, success
"""

